OL,3,CMarc Skinner steps down as Manchester
OL,4,CUnited Women head coach
OL,6,FThe head coach of Manchester United
OL,7,FWomen Marc Skinner has stepped down
OL,8,Ffrom his role just weeks before the
OL,9,FSuper League season is set to begin.
OL,11,FThe 43-year-old has been in charge of
OL,12,FUnited for five years and led the club
OL,13,Fthrough a "significant" period of
OL,14,Fprogress, leading them to their first
OL,15,Fmajor trophy with victory in the
OL,16,FWomen's FA Cup final in 2024.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/4
