OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F367A1786745077
OL,3,CMarc Skinner steps down as Manchester
OL,4,CUnited Women head coach
OL,6,FHe helped them reach the Women's
OL,7,FChampions League group stages for the
OL,8,Ffirst time in 2025, while they
OL,9,Ffinished runners-up in three domestic
OL,10,Fcup finals.
OL,12,FSkinner's departure comes a month
OL,13,Fbefore the start of the Women's Super
OL,14,FLeague season, with the Reds set to
OL,15,Ftravel to London City Lionesses on 4
OL,16,FSeptember.
OL,18,FIn a statement, the club said: "Marc
OL,19,FSkinner has departed his role as head
OL,20,Fcoach of Manchester United Women by
OL,21,Fmutual agreement.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/4
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
