PN,36703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F367A1786745077
OL,3,CMarc Skinner steps down as Manchester
OL,4,CUnited Women head coach
OL,6,F"Appointed in 2021, Marc led United to
OL,7,Ffour domestic cup finals in four
OL,8,Fseasons, winning the club's first
OL,9,Fmajor honour in women's football with
OL,10,Fthe 2024 FA Cup.
OL,12,F"During his tenure, United also
OL,13,Ffinished runners-up in the 2022`23
OL,14,FWomen's Super League, securing
OL,15,Fqualification for the UEFA Women's
OL,16,FChampions League for the first time in
OL,17,Fthe club's history.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/4
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
