PN,36704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F367A1786745077
OL,3,CMarc Skinner steps down as Manchester
OL,4,CUnited Women head coach
OL,6,F"Last season, the team reached its
OL,7,Ffirst League Cup final and the quarter-
OL,8,Ffinals of the UEFA Women's Champions
OL,9,FLeague.
OL,11,F"Marc leaves having made a significant
OL,12,Fcontribution to the continued progress
OL,13,Fof Manchester United Women.
OL,15,F"The club places on record its sincere
OL,16,Fthanks for his professionalism,
OL,17,Fcommitment and dedication throughout
OL,18,Fhis time at United, and wishes him
OL,19,Fevery success in the future."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/4
